Subject: [PATCH v11 04/12] pwm: clps711x: Cast period to u32 before use as divisor
Date:   Thu, 19 Mar 2020 18:41:15 -0700
Message-Id: <3dc95ebc6539066cc58bc44c0e6e53ac979fe9a9.1584667964.git.gurus@codeaurora.org>
